## To expT (x: Real) -> Real:
    Let mutable term be 1.0.
    Let mutable result be 1.0.
    Let mutable k be 1.0.
    While k is at most 20.0:
        Set term to (term * x) / k.
        Set result to result + term.
        Set k to k + 1.0.
    Return result.
## To siluT (x: Real) -> Real:
    Return x / (1.0 + expT(0.0 - x)).

